* OPA192 - synthetic macro-model for SM-009 parser tests (not a vendor file).
* Interface line split with + continuations, PARAMS: and inline comments.
*
.SUBCKT OPA192 IN+ IN-   ; non-inverting, inverting
+ V+ V- $ supplies
+ OUT
+ PARAMS: GAIN=1e5 IOS=1n
+ VOS=25u
R_IN IN+ IN- 1e12
E_GAIN MID 0 IN+ IN- {GAIN}
.subckt OPA192_INNER A B
R1 A B 1k
.ends OPA192_INNER
X_INNER MID OUT OPA192_INNER
.MODEL DX D(IS=1e-14)
.ENDS OPA192
